{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>36歲獨立歌手JW王灝兒與港超聯球隊班主王至尊原來早於一年前在土耳其秘密完婚，消息一出震驚整個娛樂圈。適逢兩人 …</p><p></p>\n<p>36歲獨立歌手JW王灝兒與港超聯球隊班主王至尊原來早於一年前在土耳其秘密完婚，消息一出震驚整個娛樂圈。適逢兩人結婚一周年，男方今日突然在社交平台公開多張奢華婚禮絕密相片，並撰寫長文深情告白。字裡行間意外揭露他曾經打算孤獨終老甚至人工受孕，背後原因令人意想不到。</p>\n<h2>JW首度公開土耳其奢華婚禮現場</h2>\n<p>趁著結婚一周年紀念日，JW在社交平台首度公開去年11月22日於土耳其伊斯坦堡舉行的海外婚禮相片。從曝光畫面可見，這場秘密婚禮佈置極具童話色彩，現場以大量白色鮮花作為點綴。新娘子JW王灝兒換上多套華麗服飾，當中包括一襲鑲滿閃亮碎片與銀色刺繡公主風吊帶婚紗，以及一套平口露肩純白婚紗。兩人在巨型結婚蛋糕前與璀璨煙花下深情對望，雙手緊緊相握，並與一眾守口如瓶親友共同見證這個人生重要時刻。</p>\n<h2>JW王灝兒承諾與老公並肩面對高山低谷</h2>\n<p>JW王灝兒公開感謝對方給予無限支持。她坦言夫妻兩人每天需要面對眾多難題，各自工作領域亦極具挑戰性，但承諾未來日子會繼續並肩同行。她在文中寫道：「多謝你一直都支持我鼓勵我，俾好多嘅Inspiration我令到我繼續進步！」她更強調會見證彼此高低起伏，並甜喊「I love you &amp; Happy Anniversary 王生」，以行動證明兩人感情堅固。</p>\n<h2>王至尊感激愛妻理解全天候高壓工作</h2>\n<p>據了解兩人早於英國留學時期已經相識，由於背景與價值觀相近而擦出愛火。王至尊在帖文中坦承，由於自己需要24小時全天候工作，長期處於超高壓狀態，曾經一度以為自己無法步入婚姻殿堂，甚至考慮過直接進行人工受孕。他特別剖白心聲：「講真有一段時間真係覺得自己唔會結到婚，直頭諗過人工做B就算。」他感嘆在世上尋找一個完全明白並接受這種生活模式伴侶絕對是難上加難，因此十分慶幸最終能夠遇上最了解自己終生伴侶。現時兩人暫未有補擺喜酒計畫，而早前JW王灝兒推出由老公親自監製定情新歌《JW2情歌》時，亦大方承認婚後出現幸福肥，雙方均盼望未來能夠孕育下一代。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚夫妻檔恩愛兼送上真摯祝福</h2>\n<p>兩人結婚一周年絕密婚照曝光後，隨即在網絡上引發熱烈討論，大批圈中好友與樂迷紛紛湧入社交平台留言祝賀。不少網民對於這場保密功夫做到足海外婚禮感到驚訝，留言表示「估唔到收得咁埋，一年後先公開真係好驚喜」、「土耳其搞婚禮真係好浪漫，畫面靚到好似拍戲咁」。同時亦有大批粉絲對偶像尋獲真愛感到欣慰，紛紛送上真摯祝福：「見到你搵到個咁錫你老公真係好感動」、「祝王生王太永遠幸福快樂，快啲生返個得意BB啦」。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551030168394498_4121436416b05501e20ad0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jwchubz_1795438802_4036735419878554544_179243753.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551030168394498_4121436416b05501e20ad0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jwchubz）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955103065494672_804210906b05502317aaa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jwchubz_1795438802_4036735419954058810_179243753.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17955103065494672_804210906b05502317aaa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jwchubz）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551031040111236_13512195646b05502713ea5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jwchubz_1795438802_4036735419920507968_179243753.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551031040111236_13512195646b05502713ea5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jwchubz）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551031427828870_13549198516b05502b57125.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jwchubz_1795438802_4036735419828235096_179243753.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551031427828870_13549198516b05502b57125.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jwchubz）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551032129921674_9761366376b0550320f52c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jwchubz_1795438802_4036735419870193921_179243753.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551032129921674_9761366376b0550320f52c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jwchubz）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551032914375619_11335639716b055039d2290.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"jwchubz_1795438802_4036735419828267757_179243753.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179551032914375619_11335639716b055039d2290.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@jwchubz）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/jw%e7%8e%8b%e7%81%9d%e5%85%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">jw王灝兒</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%9c%9f%e8%80%b3%e5%85%b6%e5%a9%9a%e7%a6%ae/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">土耳其婚禮</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%8e%8b%e8%87%b3%e5%b0%8a/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">王至尊</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3549361\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 24 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T10:03:53.834466+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1515,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T08:52:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T10:17:22.792652+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T09:57:22.052967+00:00","content_hash":"6791d3ccfe1388be2f26c90f5cce9e02e2bf65a6a7799604ecc33eaf258eda82","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}